# The fight froze (@s = body): the red ember line of every live trail segment goes (an fx card ages by game
# time, so it would be gone or nearly gone at the resume); p/<key>/resume lays it again.
execute as @e[type=minecraft:marker,tag=rlk_mb_hzq,scores={mbHzV=131}] if score @s mbHzT < @s mbHzW at @s positioned ~ ~0.05 ~ run kill @e[type=minecraft:item_display,tag=rlk_bk,distance=..0.05]
